  "index_test": "whole-animal-in-vivo",
  "index_test_evidence": "With these PDXs, we performed in vivo compound screens using a 1 × 1 × 1 experimental design (PDX clinical trial or PCT) to assess the population responses to 62 treatments across six indications.",
  "decision": "include",
  "reason": "The study uses patient-derived tumor xenograft models (PDXs) in vivo to screen compounds and assess their response, comparing these results to clinical trial drug response. This directly aligns with the inclusion criteria of using whole-animal in vivo models to predict human clinical outcomes."
